<item rdf:about='http://www.makumba.org/page/ListTagAttributeAuthorizeAttributeDescription'><title>ListTagAttributeAuthorizeAttributeDescription</title><link>http://www.makumba.org/page/ListTagAttributeAuthorizeAttributeDescription</link><description>Cristian Bogdan changed this page on Mon Apr 04 23:29:57 CEST 2016:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;table class="diff" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diff"&gt;At line 1 changed one line&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;&amp;quot;binding&amp;quot; will require that the user has access (canRead() ) to all returned data. If that is not the case, an UnauthorizedException is raised.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffadd"&gt;&amp;quot;binding&amp;quot; (or &amp;quot;auto&amp;quot;) requires that the user has access (canRead() ) to all returned data. If that is not the case, an UnauthorizedException is raised.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diff"&gt;At line 3 changed one line&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;&amp;quot;filter&amp;quot; will filter out the results for which canRead() is false.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffadd"&gt;&amp;quot;filter&amp;quot; filters out the results for which canRead() is false.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;</description><wiki:version>3</wiki:version><wiki:diff>http://www.makumba.org/page/ListTagAttributeAuthorizeAttributeDescription?do=Diff&amp;r1=-1</wiki:diff><dc:date>2016-04-04T21:29:57Z</dc:date><dc:creator>Cristian Bogdan</dc:creator><wiki:history>http://www.makumba.org/page/ListTagAttributeAuthorizeAttributeDescription?do=PageInfo</wiki:history></item>
<item rdf:about='http://www.makumba.org/page/QueryFragments'><title>QueryFragments</title><link>http://www.makumba.org/page/QueryFragments</link><description>Cristian Bogdan changed this page on Mon Apr 04 22:59:21 CEST 2016:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;table class="diff" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diff"&gt;At line 167 removed one line&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;[{Box&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diff"&gt;At line 169 changed 2 lines&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;(not yet implemented)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;}]&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffadd"&gt;Implicit authorisation constraints are defined in functions like canRead(), canInsert(), canUpdate(), canDelete() in the respective MDDs. Only canRead() is honoured right now. These functions will be used whenever a [mak:list|ListTag], [mak:object|ObjectTag] or [mak:*Form|FormTag] attempts to view, create, change or delete an object of the respective type. The following features are partially implemented:&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diff"&gt;At line 172 removed one line&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;Implicit authorisation constraints are defined in functions like canRead(), canInsert(), canUpdate(), canDelete() in the respective MDDs. These functions will be used whenever a [mak:list|ListTag], [mak:object|ObjectTag] or [mak:*Form|FormTag] attempts to view, create, change or delete an object of the respective type. The following features are intended:&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diff"&gt;At line 174 changed one line&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;[{Box type='fixme' author='cristi'&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffadd"&gt;* [filter out|bug:1059] from mak:list and mak:object objects that the user is not authorized to see, but do not r|aise any exception if there are such objects.This will probably be the default for [mak:list|ListTag]&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diff"&gt;At line 176 removed 2 lines&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;[filter out|bug:1059] from mak:list and mak:object objects that the user is not authorized to see, but do not r|aise any exception if there are such objects.This will probably be the default for [mak:list|ListTag]&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;}]&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diff"&gt;At line 179 changed one line&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;[{Box type='fixme' author='cristi'&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffadd"&gt;* [block access|bug:1061] to the whole page if the user is not authorized. This will probably be the default for [mak:object|ObjectTag], and [mak:*Form|FormTag]&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diff"&gt;At line 181 removed 2 lines&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;[block access|bug:1061] to the whole page if the user is not authorized. This will probably be the default for [mak:object|ObjectTag], and [mak:*Form|FormTag]&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;}]&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diff"&gt;At line 184 changed one line&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;[{Box type='fixme' author='cristi'&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffadd"&gt;* [not link|bug:1060] to a page that is not authorized&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diff"&gt;At line 186 removed 3 lines&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;[not link|bug:1060] to a page that is not authorized&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;}]&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;</description><wiki:version>3</wiki:version><wiki:diff>http://www.makumba.org/page/QueryFragments?do=Diff&amp;r1=-1</wiki:diff><dc:date>2016-04-04T20:59:21Z</dc:date><dc:creator>Cristian Bogdan</dc:creator><wiki:history>http://www.makumba.org/page/QueryFragments?do=PageInfo</wiki:history></item>
