<item rdf:about='http://www.makumba.org/page/UTF8Configuration'><title>UTF8Configuration</title><link>http://www.makumba.org/page/UTF8Configuration</link><description>Cristian Bogdan changed this page on Fri Mar 08 19:56:29 CET 2013:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;table class="diff" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diff"&gt;At line 26 changed one line&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;The filter must be used before any other filter.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffadd"&gt;The filter must be used before any other filter. If a parameter is read before the request character encoding is set to utf8, the parameter encoding is compromised. For example CAS single-sign on breaks the encoding: [https://issues.jasig.org/browse/CASC-122]&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diff"&gt;At line 28 removed one line&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="diffrem"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;</description><wiki:version>9</wiki:version><wiki:diff>http://www.makumba.org/page/UTF8Configuration?do=Diff&amp;r1=-1</wiki:diff><dc:date>2013-03-08T18:56:29Z</dc:date><dc:creator>Cristian Bogdan</dc:creator><wiki:history>http://www.makumba.org/page/UTF8Configuration?do=PageInfo</wiki:history></item>
